# Thorin Oakenshield: "artifacts and creatures you control have ward {1}" (CR 702.21a, 702.195b). With the story (Thorin,
# Mox Ruby, Mox Jet), Bot2's Abrade at Mox Jet, an artifact of Bot1's, triggers ward; Bot2's two sources went to the Abrade,
# so the {1} can't be paid and the Abrade is countered. On turn three Bot1's own Abrade destroys Bot2's Mox Sapphire: an
# opponent's artifact has no ward from Thorin (were there a ward trigger, the script's default would decline to pay it).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Ruby
Thorin Oakenshield
Mox Jet
Mountain
Abrade
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Sapphire
Abrade
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Thorin Oakenshield.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.EnduringStory = true
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Abrade.Cast
Bot2.Modes(Destroy target artifact)
Bot2.Target(Mox Jet)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Ruby; Thorin Oakenshield; Mox Jet
? Bot2.Graveyard = Abrade
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Abrade.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Destroy target artifact)
Bot1.Target(Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mountain; Mox Ruby; Thorin Oakenshield; Mox Jet
Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain
Bot2.Graveyard = Mox Sapphire; Abrade
